iedes und lobt jeden Einzelteil, weil er sein Augenmerk auf den Endzweck gerichtet hält. Als ein solcher Künstler wird nun auch hier Gott geschildert, der die einzelnen Werke lobt, damit zugleich aber auch der ganzen vollendeten Schöpfung das gebührende Lob erteilen will.","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"2ddb81bca531","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":5,"p":[17,17],"r":[104,15],"k":"reference","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"vgl. Ps 103,15","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"0a663476d037","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":5,"p":[18,18],"r":[34,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps 33,8","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"d0547dd24b6b","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":5,"p":[18,18],"r":[52,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps 51,10","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"38942fa53082","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":5,"p":[25,25],"r":[92,14],"k":"reference","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"vgl. Ps 91,14","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"9379b6e63adc","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":6,"p":[6,6],"r":[29,7],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps 28,7","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"7fd4dfc21763","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":6,"p":[18,18],"r":[136,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps 135,8.9","note":"Psalm nach Vulgata-Zählung umgerechnet; Verszählung kann abweichen"},{"id":"03333c6e67ea","v":"bkv.v142","w":"bkv.cpg-2835","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":7